OL,3,GNEWSADriver jailed for colliding with
OL,4,Aand killing cyclist
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was driving at almost double
OL,7,Fthe speed limit has been jailed after
OL,8,Fcolliding with and killing a cyclist.
OL,10,FYasin Khan was driving a white
OL,11,FVolkswagen Golf when he collided with a
OL,12,Fcyclist travelling on the A140 Farrow
OL,13,FRoad at the junction with Bowthorpe
OL,14,FRoad in Norwich on 27 February 2023.
OL,16,FThe cyclist, a man in his 30s, died at
OL,17,Fthe scene.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
