OL,3,GNEWSADriver jailed for colliding with
OL,4,Aand killing cyclist
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 23-year-old, of Rowantree Road in
OL,7,FNewcastle, pleaded guilty to causing
OL,8,Fdeath by dangerous driving and was
OL,9,Fjailed for four and a half years at
OL,10,FNorwich Crown Court on Friday.
